        "text_kGpKrk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Each pair or Rebel Nell earrings is set with a piece of reclaimed material that carries its own backstory, whether that comes from repurposed graffiti, fragments of iconic landmarks, fan-favorite sports collaborations, or college campus rocks</strong>. Because the source material varies from piece to piece, no two pairs ever look exactly the same, which is part of what makes our earring gifts feel so personal for the people who wear them and receive them. Browse the rest of our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"shop all jewelry\">unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to put real craft and real meaning into every piece we make. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every earring, so each pair carries forward both the history of its material and a story of opportunity. You can read more about <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"read our story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and read our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"read customer reviews\">customer reviews</a>. </p>"
          }
        }
